---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 首页
description: Ebola-Chan-bot 的个人博客，收录动漫观察、社会议题和长期问题写作。
---
<section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">个人博客</p>
  <h1 id="home-title">把观察写成可回看的坐标</h1>
  <p>这里收纳动漫观察、社会议题与长期问题的文章。写作不追求喧哗，重在把判断、材料和推理留在一个可以反复校验的地方。</p>
</section>

<section class="latest-section" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Latest</p>
    <h2 id="latest-title">最新文章</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="article-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="article-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">
          <span class="article-category">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <span class="article-meta">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            {% if post.data.readingTime %}<span>{{ post.data.readingTime }}</span>{% endif %}
          </span>
        </a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
